    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/10e6a5b277d13f8ea81c4b313cc1c85d.poster.avif?t=1755195340\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/10e6a5b277d13f8ea81c4b313cc1c85d.webm?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/10e6a5b277d13f8ea81c4b313cc1c85d.mp4?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marble run maker is a game about stacking physically simulated objects like books and toys to make a marble run. \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Goal-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/87effc1218ff3cb5e5aa871a59a702e1.poster.avif?t=1755195340\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/87effc1218ff3cb5e5aa871a59a702e1.webm?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/87effc1218ff3cb5e5aa871a59a702e1.mp4?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start here. End there. Build something wild in between. One goal, infinite possibilities. The only thing stopping you is your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple control-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/227a0e2e33c11e9eadca882dbdc33aef.poster.avif?t=1755195340\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/227a0e2e33c11e9eadca882dbdc33aef.webm?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/227a0e2e33c11e9eadca882dbdc33aef.mp4?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > move things around and Rotate to perfectly place where you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0fcontrols at start my be hard but once you learn them they become 2nd nature.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Undo System -</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/61a365e1aba537968f9350c5555ef320.poster.avif?t=1755195340\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/61a365e1aba537968f9350c5555ef320.webm?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/61a365e1aba537968f9350c5555ef320.mp4?t=1755195340\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made a small mistake and everything fall ;_;? no worries just undo with <strong><i>ctrl + z</i></strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And more fun mechanics are in devlopment</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if your looking to chill and make stuff this is a perfect game for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I persionally like to play this game when listning to podcast lol.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open ended puzzles meaning there is no one fit solution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >no time pressure to solve the puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy Vibes</p></li></ul>",
